flowchart LR
    U[User or System Request] --> I[Identity and Context]
    I --> P[Policy and Risk Evaluation]
    P -->|Denied| X[Block or Escalate]
    P -->|Allowed| A[Agent Orchestrator]
    A --> R[Model Router]
    R --> M[Approved Model]
    A --> K[Knowledge Retrieval]
    K --> S[Governed Sources]
    A --> T[Tool Authorization]
    T --> G[Governed Tools]
    M --> V[Output Validation]
    S --> V
    G --> V
    V --> E[Evaluation and Safety Gates]
    E -->|Pass| O[Response or Governed Action]
    E -->|Fail| X
    A --> C[Memory Controller]
    C --> D[Classified Memory Stores]
    A --> B[Telemetry and Cost Controls]
    O --> B
    X --> B
